==English==

===Adverb===
'''[[at]] the [[top]] of one's [[lungs]]'''

# {{idiomatic}} Very [[loudly]]; as loudly as ([[vocally]]) possible.
#: ''He started screaming '''at the top of his lungs''' after his team scored.''

